WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.440
Inspection, and the performance door.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:11.980
Highlighted schools have equipment dropped off for inspection. Tap the school when it's done. The guide sees it right away.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:21.310
At the performance door, tap On floor and Off floor. It's only a log: the show runs to the schedule, and nobody starts early.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.410
Thanks. Both screens refresh by themselves.
